description: Model and migration conventions
globs:
  - "**/models.py"
  - "**/migrations/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Models & migrations

- Every tenant-scoped model: `community_id` + `city_id`; city-shared: `city_id` only.
- Use a tenant-aware default manager so queries are filtered by default.
- Models singular (`Event`, `Membership`). Money = integer minor units / Decimal.
- Datetimes UTC. Add DB indexes for all filterable fields (city, date, category, price).
- One logical change per migration. NEVER edit an already-applied migration.
- Enforce invariants at the DB level where possible (constraints, atomic checks).